# Build context for Dockerfile.dev.
#
# BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore, so
# this file overrides the repo-root .dockerignore (which keeps the context for
# Dockerfile.release small). The dev image needs experiments/ and the rest of
# the tree, and excludes only what is never part of a build.
#
# NOTE: per-dockerfile ignore files are a BuildKit feature. Building with
# DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0 or Docker < 23.0 falls back to the root .dockerignore.
.git
bazel-*
